    <Description><![CDATA[SynHost block â€” carousel animado con autoplay, touch gestures, lazy load. DOM: <synergos-carousel>. Distinto de elementCorpBannerSlider SSR (SSR emite todos los slides inline + CSS-only nav). Este es CDN-hosted con JS completo para transiciones, pagination dots, keyboard nav. Props: slidesJson (array de {imageUrl, alt, caption, linkUrl}), autoplayInterval (ms, 0 = off).]]></Description>
